{
 "title": "Loka style A redesign part 2, polish pass: brighter buildings, one camera, cuter trees",
 "conventions": {
  "density": "sprite px per art px. World sprites are 2x: draw each sprite px at P/2 device px. Agents stay 4x (P/4).",
  "size": "1.25x of today's on-screen size, so doors clear 1.5x agents. Re-shrink from finals/ for any other size, never scale a PNG.",
  "snap": "Snap rule B: css = max(2, floor(min(w/320, h/192))), P = 4*floor(css*min(dpr,2)/4 + 0.5). P is always even, so 2x sprites stay pixel exact.",
  "anchor": "Ground contact point in sprite px, bottom centre (x = w/2, y = h). Drop shadows are not baked: draw an ellipse rx = 0.42*w, ry = 0.07*w at the anchor.",
  "footprint": "Suggested blocked tiles (16 art px) at the anchor row. Buildings: ceil(art_w/16) x 4 (today: 6 x 3). Others: 1 row.",
  "glow": "No glow. Windows, lamps and the portal are never lit at night: glow is null on every item, and night is only the darker tint.",
  "sign": "Blank board rect in sprite px where the engine draws the place name (divide by 2 for art px).",
  "palette": "Own palette per sprite (median cut from its final plus up to 3 kept accents, plum ink outline). Indexed PNG with 1 transparent index. Polish pass: wood lifted toward honey, grey stone warmed toward cream, plum ink outline kept.",
  "points": "Named spots in sprite px from the sprite's top-left. [x, y] is a point, [x, y, w, h] a rect. door is the bottom centre of the door opening, sign repeats the sign rect, chimney and smoke are where smoke starts, light, flame and clock_face are centres. Shop variants share the shop's points. For a re-shrink to new_w x new_h, multiply x and w by new_w/w and y and h by new_h/h. {} means no useful spot."
 },
